                    134.0,
                    982.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Below the dotted line in Table 6, the performance of the human readers is shown for comparison. Estimating the emotional intensity of writers is difficult for both human readers and machine learning models.",
            "block_bbox": [
