                    605.0,
                    1029.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Estimating the writer’s subjective emotions with higher accuracy is future work. We have shown the possibility of improving the performance of subjective emotional intensity estimation by considering the personality of the writer. It may be worth considering the writer’s meta information, including personality, and the writer’s past posting history.",
            "block_bbox": [
